# Qoder-generated repo wiki: derived from the code, rewritten wholesale on
# regeneration, and hand edits to it are lost. Treat it as a local cache.
# The hand-maintained source of truth is ARCHITECTURE.md (see also AGENTS.md).
.qoder/

# AI-agent skill installs. `npx skills add` mirrors every skill into .claude/skills as a
# symlink farm for Claude Code, and graphify writes its generated graph (graph.html, graph.json,
# GRAPH_REPORT.md and its incremental cache) into a graphify-out/ next to whatever it scanned —
# the repo root and app/ both have one. Both are derived local state; the tracked skill sources
# live under .agents/skills/, so there is nothing here worth committing.
.claude/
graphify-out/
